{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "984cff2d-f62f-80b1-94d8-2dc61962825e",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T10:33:31-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:30:03-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:30:07-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. My name is Joel Spencer. I'm calling about a storm drain on Farewell Street. It's in front of my mother's house, 461 Farewell, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:30:17-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 461 Farewell. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:30:21-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate at the curb has sunk. It's down lower than the pavement around it, and when it rains the water goes everywhere but down it. It runs across the front of her walkway and pools at the end of the driveway. We had the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago, and it did it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:30:40-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that was a lot of water over the weekend. So the grate itself has dropped, it's not clogged with leaves or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:30:48-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's not clogged. I cleared the leaves off it myself. It's sunk. The asphalt around it is higher than the grate, so the water goes around it. It's been like that a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:00-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Have you reported this before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:03-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My mother called a while back. She was told it was a state road. That's all she got. Nobody came out, nobody looked at it. So I'm asking you now. Is it a city drain or a state one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:17-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. Farewell Street, let me pull it up. [pause] I'm sorry, are you out somewhere? I hear a lot of background."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:25-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at the drugstore. I'm buying batteries for her smoke detector. It was chirping. Anyway, the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:31-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good on you for the batteries. So, Farewell is a long street and parts of it do get handled differently. I can't tell you from here that it's definitely one or the other for your block. The map I have is showing the street, but I'd want the engineering folks to confirm who owns that particular drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:51-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you don't know either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:31:54-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for that exact spot, no. Here's what I can do. I'll put in a request with the address and describe the sunken grate and the water running across the walkway. Someone will look at it and figure out whose it is. If it's the state's, we'll pass it along to them instead of leaving you hanging."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last time it was just, it's the state's, and that was the end of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:19-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. This time it gets logged under the address, so there's a record and it doesn't depend on someone remembering. Can I get a good number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:30-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:31-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven two. And that's your cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:35-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's mine, not my mother's. She doesn't pick up unknown numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:40-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know. And I'm putting down that the grate has sunk below the pavement, water bypasses it, and it happened again after the rain Friday and Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:50-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Add that it's been this way through the whole winter. Every time it rains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:32:56-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Every rain, all winter. I can't give you a day for when someone will be out, but it will go to the crew that looks at drainage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:33:06-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'd like somebody to call me back and tell me whose it is. Even if it's the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:33:13-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that you want a call back with the answer on ownership. Anything else going on at the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:33:20-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:33:22-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, Mr. Spencer. Hang in there, and tell your mom the smoke detector is sorted at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:33:29-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
